      "body": "## Summary\n\nDeepSeek-style NextN drafts (e.g. GLM-5.3-Flash MTP) skipped prefill CUDA graph capture (`draft model does not have a 'layers' attribute`) because `DeepseekModelNextN` holds its block as `decoder`. Add a read-only `layers` property returning `(self.decoder,)`.\n\n4x GB300, GLM-5.3-Flash Low Latency recipe; baseline = same commit without this change.\n\nGSM8K (sgl-eval, thinking, temp 1.0, top_p 0.95, max tokens 16384):\n\n| | Baseline | This PR |\n|---|---|---|\n| Score | 97.04% | 97.35% |\n| Accept length | 3.08 | 3.06 |\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38348133689](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38348133689)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38348133366](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38348133366)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38348133816](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38348133816)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
